1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,352
Only have a week off?

2
00:00:01,352 --> 00:00:03,207
Pick one of these 4 Caminos.

3
00:00:03,207 --> 00:00:04,455
One: the French Way

4
00:00:04,455 --> 00:00:05,532
from Sarria.

5
00:00:05,532 --> 00:00:06,190
The classic,

6
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:07,452
and the liveliest.

7
00:00:07,452 --> 00:00:08,624
Two: the English Way

8
00:00:08,624 --> 00:00:09,616
from Ferrol.

9
00:00:09,616 --> 00:00:10,704
Estuaries, harbours

10
00:00:10,704 --> 00:00:12,052
