11
00:00:12,052 --> 00:00:13,311
Three: Santiago

12
00:00:13,311 --> 00:00:14,421
to Finisterre.

13
00:00:14,421 --> 00:00:15,638
It ends at the sea,

14
00:00:15,638 --> 00:00:17,138
