15
00:00:17,138 --> 00:00:18,245
Four: the Primitive Way

16
00:00:18,245 --> 00:00:19,247
from Lugo.

17
00:00:19,247 --> 00:00:20,476
The oldest Camino,

18
00:00:20,476 --> 00:00:21,943
